          "comment": "[Playbook] The 60-day warranty running from the Effective Date and expiring no later than December 31, 1999 would lapse at or before acceptance under Section 3.1, so we have extended it to twelve (12) months from acceptance and added a professional and workmanlike standard for Commerce One's services, consistent with our playbook position. We can accept ninety (90) days from acceptance as a fallback if the longer period is an issue.",
